1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,741
This is Repeat AI.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,584
You can import a Google Sheet link or an Excel file.

3
00:00:06,584 --> 00:00:08,123
Here, we'll use the link.

4
00:00:08,123 --> 00:00:10,276
Choose the buildings, then add the spreadsheet.

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:23,317
On Sellers, you can filter by status: prospect, market appraisal, for sale, or not interested.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,866
Sold today shows fresh transactions in that building.

7
00:00:28,866 --> 00:00:32,448
Open a seller to see the sales, dates and prices.

8
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:40,787
With WhatsApp connected, eligible sellers get automated updates using those transactions.

9
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,400
You can use the default message or write your own.

10
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,501
Here, we'll add a name, a building and recent sales.

11
00:00:51,501 --> 00:00:53,361
The preview updates as you type.

12
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:06,575
Next, choose which buildings get messages on each day.

13
00:01:06,575 --> 00:01:10,809
Pick a spreadsheet, select its building, and repeat for the other days.

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,810
We've filled Monday through Thursday.

15
00:01:18,810 --> 00:01:20,259
Now save the plan.

16
00:01:20,259 --> 00:01:21,707
Empty days stay off.

17
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:31,112
To track price drops, open a building and choose an apartment.

18
00:01:31,112 --> 00:01:33,137
The chart shows the asking price.

19
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,912
Open Activity to see when that price changed.

20
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:50,180
Connect your spreadsheets, email and calendars.

21
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:57,384
You can also type or speak to Ask Repeat.

22
00:01:57,384 --> 00:02:02,026
It can find sellers, summarise the market, and prepare changes, like a new template.

23
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,277
Check the draft, then confirm.

24
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:15,250
Repeat AI works on web, Windows and mobile.
